  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Near Snowy Mountain blessed land, Central Continent Gu Immortals see small areas completely transformed by dao marks. Some patches are filled with lightning path dao marks, alongside ice path, wind path, and soul path patches, each denser than what those rank seven cultivators hold after bitter cultivation.",
      "chapters": [
        813
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_snowy_mountain",
        "reg_central_continent",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "General dao marks and attainment levels are covered on dao marks and attainment.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_dao_marks"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Vicious Lightning Fiend sends out lightning deities that contain lightning path dao marks, each with the battle strength of a Gu Immortal.",
      "chapters": [
        847
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "lightning-deities",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_vicious_lightning_fiend"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After He Lang Zi transforms into a lightning flash giant wolf, lightning path dao marks remain on his body. He must cleanse those leftover marks before transforming again, or the remaining marks harm him; enduring Fang Yuan’s attacks while stripping the lightning path dao marks is possible but slow.",
      "chapters": [
        877
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "marks-left-by-lightning-form",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_he_lang_zi",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The Blazing Glory Lightning Brilliance immortal zombie body has an abundance of fire path and lightning path dao marks and is extremely suited to be used to refine Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        929
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "refinement-suited-zombie-body",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_blazing_glory_lightning_brilliance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Lady Wan Shou’s repeated failures to lightning refine Ma Hong Yun into a rank eight Immortal Gu leave many lightning path dao marks engraved on his body. If he cultivated lightning path, those marks would give him tremendous help.",
      "chapters": [
        1267
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "engraved-by-failed-lightning-refinement",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_lady_wan_shou",
        "char_ma_hong_yun",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Thunder Ghost True Monarch’s final move condenses all of her lightning path dao marks into her heart and detonates them at once. Afterward the battlefield has no lightning path dao marks remaining, which Fang Yuan reads as proof she used every mark and had lightning path great grandmaster attainment.",
      "chapters": [
        1582
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "condensed-heart-detonation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_thunder_ghost_true_monarch"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Wan Zi Hong’s wood path healing method gets rid of the lightning path dao marks Nu Er Bao Xiong landed on Zhang Fei Xiong, so the wound heals rapidly even though wood path and transformation path marks would ordinarily conflict.",
      "chapters": [
        1718
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "healing-that-strips-marks",
